<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#000000">
<title>管理者の暗証番号</title>
<style>
html, body { margin: 0; height: 100%; background: #000; color: #fff; }
body { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: -apple-system, "Hiragino Sans", sans-serif; padding: env(safe-area-inset-top) 20px env(safe-area-inset-bottom); box-sizing: border-box; }
.ad { width: 100%; max-width: 360px; text-align: center; }
h1 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 22px; color: #fff; }
.msg { font-size: 44px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 22px; color: #fff; min-height: 56px; }
.win { font-size: 64px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 18px; color: #fff; }
p { font-size: 14px; color: #cfcfcf; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px; }
input[type=password] { width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 34px; letter-spacing: 12px; text-align: center; padding: 14px 10px; background: #111; color: #fff; border: 2px solid #555; border-radius: 14px; margin-bottom: 14px; font-family: inherit; }
input[type=password]:focus { outline: none; border-color: #fff; }
input[type=password]::placeholder { font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0; color: #777; }
button { width: 100%; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; padding: 14px; border: 0; border-radius: 14px; background: #fff; color: #000; font-family: inherit; }
a { color: #bbb; font-size: 14px; }
.back { margin-top: 26px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="ad">
  {% if win %}
  <div class="win">正解！</div>
  <p>設定を開きます…</p>
  <script>setTimeout(function () { location.href = {{ next|json_encode|raw }}; }, 1500);</script>
  <p><a href="{{ next }}">開かない時は、ここを押してください</a></p>
  {% elseif unset %}
  <h1>管理者の暗証番号</h1>
  <p>暗証番号が、まだ決まっていません。サーバーの設定（config.php）に、管理者の暗証番号（数字）を入れると、この画面が開けるようになります。</p>
  {% else %}
  <h1>管理者の暗証番号</h1>
  <div class="msg">{{ error }}</div>
  <form method="post" action="/admin/unlock">
    <input type="hidden" name="next" value="{{ next }}">
    <input type="text" name="user" value="admin" autocomplete="username" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
    <input type="password" name="pass" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]*" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="暗証番号" required autofocus>
    <button type="submit">開く</button>
  </form>
  {% endif %}
  <div class="back"><a href="/">← 在庫にもどる</a></div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
